## Notes: Fully editable, consolidated buff and debuff bar replacing Blizzard's (and pfUI's) own player buff frame. Buffs sort into color-coded categories you fully control - rename, recolor, reorder, delete, or create your own, and reassign any buff to any category by hand. Crowded categories collapse into one icon on request. Debuffs get their own bar, color-coded by dispel type. Styled after pfUI (bundled assets, not a live dependency) with full manual control over font/size/borders/layout.
